      "Frees about {size}. Deletes this version and any original files only it uses. This can\u2019t be undone.": "Libera aprox. {size}. Elimina esta versi\xF3n y los archivos originales que solo usa esta versi\xF3n. No se puede deshacer.",
      "Group \u201C{chat}\u201D ({platform}){gap}{when}": "Grupo \u201C{chat}\u201D ({platform}){gap}{when}",
      "Group actions: {name}": "Acciones del grupo: {name}",
      "Handle this task in Swarm coordinator mode: 1. Split the work into 2\u20136 non-overlapping parallel tracks; 2. Match each track to the best enabled subagent type from the subagent library (such as web-research, knowledge-research, doc-maker, fact-check, custom subagents, or built-in explore/general), prioritizing any subagent types @-mentioned by the user; 3. Dispatch all independent subagents in parallel in a single turn with clear boundaries and deliverables; 4. Once all subagents return, cross-check and synthesize one clear, structured final answer.": "Gestiona esta tarea en modo coordinador Swarm: 1. Divide el trabajo en 2\u20136 l\xEDneas paralelas sin solapamiento; 2. Asigna a cada una el subagente activo m\xE1s adecuado (web-research, knowledge-research, doc-maker, fact-check, personalizados o explore/general), priorizando los @-mencionados; 3. Lanza en paralelo todos los subagentes independientes en un solo turno con l\xEDmites y entregables claros; 4. Al terminar todos, contrasta e integra una respuesta final clara y estructurada.",
      "Help me set up Skills (shared by all chats). First check the existing skills and the tools available now, then create or edit skills as needed. When installing, use the actual directory provided by the host below, and keep existing content and enabled states. If the current tools can\u2019t write to that directory, tell me clearly instead of guessing another path.\n\n## Location\n- Skills directory: {skillsDirPath}\n\n## Skill format\nEach skill is a subdirectory of skills/, and the directory name is its slug.\nIt contains a SKILL.md file in this format:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-skill\ndescription: Short description\n---\n\nDetailed instructions for the skill...\n```\n\n## Current skills\n{skillList}\n\nLook at the skills/ directory to see the existing setup, then create or edit skills based on what I need.": "Ay\xFAdame a configurar Skills (compartido en todos los chats). Revisa primero las skills existentes y las herramientas disponibles, y luego crea o edita skills seg\xFAn necesite. Al instalar, usa el directorio real indicado abajo y conserva el contenido y estado activo. Si las herramientas actuales no pueden escribir all\xED, d\xEDmelo claramente sin suponer otra ruta.\n\n## Ubicaci\xF3n\n- Directorio de Skills: {skillsDirPath}\n\n## Formato de Skill\nCada skill es un subdirectorio de skills/ cuyo nombre es su slug.\nContiene un archivo SKILL.md con este formato:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-skill\ndescription: Descripci\xF3n breve\n---\n\nInstrucciones detalladas para la skill...\n```\n\n## Skills actuales\n{skillList}\n\nRevisa el directorio skills/ para ver la configuraci\xF3n existente y crea o edita skills seg\xFAn lo que necesite.",
